  "level": 2,
  "questionLabels": [],
  "question": {
    "text": "The mean and standard deviation of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>15</mn></math> observations were found to be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>12</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math> respectively. On rechecking it was found that an observation was read as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn></math> in place of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>12</mn><mo>.</mo></math> If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>μ</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math> denote the mean and variance of the correct observations respectively, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>15</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>μ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math> is equal to _________.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "2521",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given: Incorrect mean, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><menclose notation=\"top\"><mi>x</mi></menclose><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></math> and incorrect standard deviation, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>Σx</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></msub><mn>15</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mi>Σx</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>180</mn></math></p><p>Correct mean is given by,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>Σx</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow><mn>15</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>182</mn><mn>15</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Also, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mn>15</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>144</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mn>15</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>144</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mo>∑</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>2295</mn></math></p><p>Correct <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>Σx</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>2295</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>144</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2339</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math> (correct variance) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2339</mn><mn>15</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>182</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>182</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>15</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>15</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>182</mn><mn>15</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>182</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>182</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>15</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>2339</mn><mn>15</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>182</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>182</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>15</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>15</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>182</mn><mn>15</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>2339</mn><mn>15</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>15</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2521</mn></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
